        "intuition": "Total boundedness gives a Cauchy subsequence (finite resolution forces clustering); completeness gives it a limit inside the space. Together they yield convergent subsequences.",
        "watch": "Both halves are needed and each is non-trivial. This metric characterization is the doorway to the compactness zoo, where covers and nets take over."
