        "intuition": "The operator analogue of a real number — the model for physical observables, whose measured values (spectrum) are real.",
        "watch": "For BOUNDED operators self-adjoint = symmetric. For unbounded operators symmetric (⟨Tx,y⟩=⟨x,Ty⟩ on a domain) is strictly weaker than self-adjoint, which also requires the domains of T and T* to coincide."
