          "(2Z,+) is a substructure of (Z,+) isomorphic to it (hence ≡), but not elementary: Z |= exists x (x+x = 2)",
          "Keisler–Shelah: M ≡ N iff some ultrapowers of M and N are isomorphic (ZFC, Shelah 1971)",
