          "Skolemization: in a language expanded by Skolem functions every substructure is automatically elementary — this is how downward Löwenheim–Skolem is proved",
          "The algebraic numbers Qbar ≼ C in the ring language, and the real algebraic numbers ≼ R in the ordered-ring language, by model completeness of ACF and RCF",
