        "gist": "CH asserts there is no cardinality strictly between N and R, equivalently 2^aleph_0 = aleph_1 under AC; Cantor announced it in 1878, failed to prove it, and Hilbert made it problem one. For sets that can be described concretely the dichotomy is already a ZFC theorem.",
