        "zoo": "induction",
        "note": "Incompleteness largely measures induction strength: I-Sigma_1 vs PA vs PA + TI(eps_0); Gentzen proves Con(PA) by transfinite induction up to eps_0, and Goodstein and the hydra are unprovable in PA precisely because they need induction past it."
