        "gist": "In an irreducible space any two nonempty opens meet, so an infinite variety is T1 but never Hausdorff; separatedness (diagonal closed in the fibre product) replaces Hausdorff, and completeness/properness replaces compactness, since quasi-compactness comes for free and says nothing.",
