          "Poisson's formula in n = 2 obtained by Hadamard's method of descent, with its (c^2t^2 - |y-x|^2)^{-1/2} tail",
          "The forward fundamental solution as delta(|x| - ct)/(4 pi c^2 t) in 3D: a measure on the light cone, not a function",
