          "Petrowsky's lacuna criterion and the Atiyah-Bott-Garding theory for constant-coefficient hyperbolic operators; Stellmacher's nontrivial Huygens operators in higher dimensions show Hadamard's problem is subtler than expected, and the full classification remains open"
