          "Bounded translation-invariant operators on L^2(R^n) = Fourier multipliers with m in L^inf; on L^1 they are convolutions with finite measures (Wendel)",
          "Hormander-Mikhlin and Marcinkiewicz multiplier theorems for L^p, 1 < p < inf",
