          "Stationary phase: for a in C_c^inf with a single nondegenerate critical point, int a e^{i lam phi} dxi ~ (2pi/lam)^{n/2} |det phi''|^{-1/2} e^{i lam phi + i pi sgn(phi'')/4} a(xi_0) + O(lam^{-n/2-1})",
