          "Schauder fixed point for quasilinear Dirichlet problems: freeze the coefficients at v, solve the resulting linear problem, and show the map v |-> u is compact via Schauder/De Giorgi-Nash-Moser estimates",
          "Leray-Schauder degree plus Gidas-Spruck a priori bounds: existence of positive solutions of -Lap u = u^p on bounded smooth domains for 1 < p < (n+2)/(n-2)",
