          "Constant-coefficient PDE: P(D) has symbol P(2 pi i xi); the heat semigroup is e^{-4 pi^2 t |xi|^2}, the wave propagators are cos(2 pi t|xi|) and sin(2 pi t|xi|)/(2 pi|xi|), and the Schrodinger group has unimodular symbol, hence unitary with no smoothing.",
