        "name": "Multiresolution analysis and the refinement equation",
        "gist": "The axiomatic machine that manufactures wavelets: a nested ladder of resolution spaces generated by dilating one scaling function, with the two-scale equation and the QMF condition as its algebraic shadow. Almost every construction in the subject is 'choose a filter m_0, then check it'.",
