          "Putzer's algorithm: e^{tA} = sum_{k=0}^{n-1} r_{k+1}(t) prod_{j<=k}(A - lambda_j I), where the r_k solve a triangular scalar ODE chain -- eigenvalues only, no eigenvectors",
