          "Krein's theorem: all multipliers on the unit circle with definite Krein signature implies strong (structurally robust) stability",
          "Krein collision: two unit-circle multipliers of opposite signature must meet before they can leave the circle",
          "Linear stability of L4/L5 in the elliptic restricted three-body problem, and of halo orbits in the CR3BP, computed from monodromy matrices"
