          "Delay equations x'(t) = L(t)x_t with T-periodic L: the period map on C([-tau,0]) is compact once T >= tau, so its nonzero spectrum consists of multipliers accumulating only at 0 (milling-chatter stability lobes)",
          "Driven quantum systems: quasi-energies as Floquet exponents, Shirley's formalism and the Floquet-Magnus expansion"
