          "Watson's lemma: if f(t) ~ sum a_n t^{alpha_n} as t -> 0+ (alpha_n increasing, > -1) then int_0^inf e^{-lam t} f(t) dt ~ sum a_n Gamma(alpha_n + 1)/lam^{alpha_n + 1}",
