          "geometric Lorenz attractor reduces to a one-dimensional expanding Lorenz map of positive entropy (Tucker's 2002 computer-assisted proof that the classical parameters realize such an attractor); Sarig's countable-state Markov partitions code positive-entropy C^{1+alpha} surface diffeomorphisms"
