          "Global error bound ||e_n|| <= (C/L)(e^{L(t_n-t_0)}-1)h^p — sharp for y'=Ly",
          "Explicit Euler on the harmonic oscillator: |x_{n+1}|^2 = (1+h^2)|x_n|^2, energy grows geometrically; backward Euler decays — neither is right",
