          "triangle identities for an adjunction F -| G: (eps F).(F eta) = 1_F and (G eps).(eta G) = 1_G",
          "monad axioms mu.(T mu) = mu.(mu T) and mu.(T eta) = mu.(eta T) = 1_T, all equations between natural transformations",
          "Eckmann-Hilton: End(1_C) = Nat(1_C,1_C) is a commutative monoid, the center of C; for C = R-Mod it is Z(R)",
