          "Filtered vector spaces: the identity map from (V, fine filtration) to (V, coarse filtration) is mono and epi without being iso",
          "Torsion-free abelian groups: coker(f) = (usual cokernel)/torsion, so 2: Z -> Z has zero cokernel and is mono + epi + not iso — the category is not balanced",
          "Topological abelian groups and Frechet spaces: same failure mode; the fix is Quillen's exact-category axioms rather than abelianness"
