          "CRT: O_K/a ≅ prod_i O_K/P_i^{a_i} for a = prod P_i^{a_i}",
          "1.5-generation: every nonzero ideal is (a,b) with a any prescribed nonzero element of it",
          "Steinitz: a finitely generated torsion-free module of rank r over a Dedekind R is isomorphic to R^{r-1} ⊕ a, and is determined up to isomorphism by r and the class of a in Cl(R)",
