        "name": "The theorem: log embedding, discreteness, full rank",
        "gist": "Everything follows from mapping units to their vector of log conjugate-sizes: the norm condition puts the image in a hyperplane, finiteness of integers with bounded conjugates makes it discrete with torsion kernel, and geometry of numbers makes it full rank. The clean modern packaging is a compactness statement about ideles.",
