          "Abel/partial summation converting sum_{p<=x} 1 into sum_{p<=x} log p and back — the standard bridge between pi(x), theta(x) and psi(x)",
          "General principle: if sum f(n)n^{-s} = zeta(s) G(s) with G convergent past the pole, the main term of sum_{n<=x} f(n) is G(1) x"
