          "Serre's open image theorem (1972): if E/Q has no CM, rho_{E,l} is surjective for all but finitely many l and the adelic image is open; the uniform version (surjectivity for all l > 37) is OPEN",
          "Modularity theorem: Wiles and Taylor-Wiles (1995, semistable), completed by Breuil-Conrad-Diamond-Taylor (2001) — every E/Q is modular",
